rw-contract v1
id: R05
name: mul-mul-merge
label: manual reducing
semantics: omega.v0.wrap
domain: wrap
widths: 8 16 32 64
overflow: wrap modulo 2^w (OVERFLOW_WRAP)
rounding: none (integer)
shape: scalar u_w -> u_w
aliasing: none (one register, no memory)
effects: none (pure)
params: a b
ops: -
assume: -
lhs: (mul (mul x a) b)
rhs: (mul x (mul a b))
derive:
  (mul x (mul a b)) by mul-assoc
end
